{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_mm_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_mm_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"大侦探探案集·卷一","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mm_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"8c2df0756793e487f26fb80f841a7700f6d80bc04b49a72f278691af4ea6eef6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"布莱德夫人的死亡时间已经确定是在昨天夜里，女仆锁上大门之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"庄园警备森严，三面被人工湖环绕，庄园和人工湖之间建有高墙，地理位置非常特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外人想要侵入装设有警戒设备的别墅内部，并且不被任何人发现，是不可能的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，凶手就在诸位之中！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"梅缇丝小姐，这、这是真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"难以置信！我们之中怎么会有那样残忍的杀人凶手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"别开玩笑了，这绝无可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"从容的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梅缇丝小姐这么说，难道已经找到能够锁定嫌犯的证据了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？这、这个嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳嗯！证据当然是有啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，根据女仆的证词，原本应该在卧室内的一个小型精炼源石摆件在案发后不知所终，这立刻引起了本侦探的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从死者头部致命伤的打击面来看，我怀疑那就是犯人使用的凶器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你该不会想说，带着凶器的人就是凶手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有那样的东西，我想应该不会有人特地带在身上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安静，安静！不要打断本侦探的推理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本侦探当然不会这么说！下面就是我要说的第二点：案发现场十分凌乱，死者面部和手部都沾有大量血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除去头部的致命伤外，布莱德夫人的身上还有多处伤口，海蒂小姐，你知道这意味着什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这意味着......凶手与死者之间，曾发生过冲突？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错！而且还是流血冲突！流血的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凶手处在至近距离，不论如何，一定会沾到死者的血液，所以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身上带着血迹的人，就一定是真凶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！我的推理如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，简直是一派胡言！你看好了，在场诸位之中，可没有谁身上带着血迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！可、可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会没有呢？不可能......犯人、犯人绝对就在我们之中！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你这家伙是不是傻啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......你怎么忽然骂人？！凛冬你对本侦探有什么不满？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我可没骂你，只是实话实说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我也没期待你的这个第一个案子能有多精彩，但你这破绽也太多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，安娜也同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真理！怎么连你也......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就目前听到的部分而言，确实会让人产生这样的疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你的推理是没有错，但是，真正的凶手不可能就这样穿着带血的衣物出现在他人面前，对方一定会想办法处理掉对自己不利的证据......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定的，正常人都会这么干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......确实是这样没错啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"犯人也没有笨到会带着一身血迹行动的程度，而且，当时在庄园内的所有人都一口咬定，没有见过身上带血的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，不过，本侦探当然也早就考虑到了这一点，所以当时——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经检查了我们所有人的物品，根本没有什么沾血的衣物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"依我看，这场闹剧差不多也该结束了吧！梅缇丝·杰拉尔丁小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是这不可能，一定是遗漏了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"但是梅缇丝小姐，结果您也看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，我们大家都接受了检查，没有什么可疑的东西呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，这件事就应当交给警察处理，我想，我们应该已经可以离开了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这已经耽搁了不少时间了，实在不能再奉陪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不可以走！再给我一点时间！现在还不能就这么下结论！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定！一定会找到证据！找到真凶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请再给我一点时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......您说呢，海蒂小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想请各位......再多留下一段时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜，海蒂小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂小姐，难道您真的相信我们之中有真凶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然愿意相信在座各位不会犯下这样可怕的罪行，既然如此，不妨就让侦探小姐用证据来证明我们的清白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们现在离开，万一事后警方也无法查明真相，外面的人会如何猜测，各位应该都可以想象得到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流言蜚语可从来不会明辨是非呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这样说，倒也有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，既然是海蒂小姐的请求，那就再等一阵子也无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是要看看，这个自称侦探的小姑娘能找到什么证据！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫自称侦探的小姑娘......本侦探还需要自称吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本侦探......呃，虽然确实是第一次接这样的案子......但是绝对会漂亮地破案的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我记好了！那个拿鼻孔看人的混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，梅缇丝小姐，您别在意，我们自然都是相信您的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的支持！哈尔先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈尔先生，您的外套怎么和领结不太配套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是吗？可能是出门时，下人拿错了外套吧，真是让您见笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不耽搁梅缇丝小姐的时间了，我们等着您的好消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，别发呆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威廉爵士虽然态度强硬了一些，但不管怎么说，他都还算配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅缇丝小姐怀疑威廉爵士是凶手......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒也不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......本侦探现在另有怀疑对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不说这个，刚刚我就想问了......我拜托你调查的事情怎么样了，海蒂小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"房间检查什么也没发现，完全无法锁定真凶，现在我可以信任的只有身为委托人的海蒂小姐你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，没错！欢呼吧，你就是本侦探的第一任助手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那真是荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，委托人是犯人的可能性也是有的哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？当、当然！我当然有考虑过这一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然海蒂小姐你有不在场证明，但我可没有因此而放松警惕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不过是侦探用来迷惑嫌疑人，让人放松警惕的小手段......没错，就是这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，好的，那我可要更努力地给自己洗刷嫌疑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，要先听听我调查的结果吗，侦探小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然——要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庄园内检查结果如何？有没有人私下进入厨房，或者在夜里使用了壁炉？还有其他能点火的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾。就我调查到的结果来看，答案是——没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仆人们守着厨房，互相之间可以作证，没有人出入。所有房间的壁炉都没有点火的痕迹，并没有人使用壁炉烧毁任何东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，还是没有任何线索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"犯人绝对不会把这样的证据带在身边，一定会想方设法把证据销毁，最不留后患的方法就是用火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是......源石技艺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是使用了源石技艺的话，那岂不是能凭空用火焰把证据都烧毁，这样一来，就更加不可能找到证据了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也不对......精炼源石做成的摆件没有那么容易烧掉，总会留下点什么痕迹的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，庄园内能找的地方，我们应该都已经找过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果什么都没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（连最基本的凶器都找不到，这个案子，我该怎么破？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......果然靠我一个人还是不行吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梅缇丝小姐，要放弃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，才不是放弃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是觉得证据一定已经被销毁，没有希望了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实没能找到线索......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（海蒂小姐作为委托人，一定也很失望吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，糟糕，眼泪要掉下来了......不行，给我回去！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、呜、不起，海蒂小姐，如果你不满意，我可以、可以帮你联络更有经验的侦探！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是能不能请你再给我一点时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定、一定会......不要现在换掉我呜呜啊啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可从来没有说过，打算更换委托对象呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是新人侦探，但我认为一心寻找线索的梅缇丝小姐很有成为大侦探的潜力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算真的失去一两条线索，应该也还可以从其他的方向入手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相一直就在那里，不会改变，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相一直就在那里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“只要是犯罪就一定会留下痕迹”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得没错呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一时没有收获而已，如果就此灰心丧气，可和我心目中的大侦探不太相符呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是，我还只是个没什么名气的侦探，这还是我第一次接手这样的大案子，呜......我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我一个人的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我记得我委托的，可是一位自信满满的侦探小姐呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，怎么能说是只有一个人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，难道我不是大侦探的第一任助手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是梅缇丝小姐刚刚亲口说的，不能这么快就反悔哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇啊啊海蒂小姐......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！本侦探迟早有一天一定会成为家喻户晓的名侦探！到时候所有人都会知道，海蒂小姐就是本侦探最初的助手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，恶心。好肉麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，说得太过分了。只是有点不适合吃饭的时候听而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你这说法和我的有什么区别啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且犯人不明显就是那个胖子嘛，这哪还有悬念啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都没区别！都好过分啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是本侦探的第一个案子里第二感人的情节欸！！侦探和助手欸！！在侦探心灰意冷的时刻，体贴的助手站出来温柔鼓励......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道不够让人感动吗？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这个嘛，确实应该是很感人的一幕，吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"侦探和助手之间的互动，确实是很多推理小说的卖点之一。那些流传甚广的经典作品，大多也都会塑造这样两个相辅相成的形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧！嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是当事人之一的侦探是这个样子，实在没什么文学性可言。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，别扯你那之后再也没见过面的第一任助手了，上回你不是还擅自封天火那个大小姐为你的第七任助手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那家伙气得差点都要拿火烧你了。我看人家只是随口鼓励你一下，只有你一个人在感动吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，才不是！侦探和助手的事，说了你也不懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，行，我不懂就我不懂。快说之后怎么样了，快点说完我好专心吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后嘛，那自然是本侦探重振旗鼓，大显神威......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，现场还是和之前看过的一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（现场已经找过很多遍了，再看也不会冒出新的线索。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还是去别的地方再找找吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里也没有......也是，本来也不可能把沾了血的重要证据丢在这种随时可能被发现的地方吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的脑袋......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorgarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（没有，没有，这里也没有异常。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪，肯定有哪里是我忽略了的......但是，到底会在哪里？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道真的已经被彻底销毁了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不可能！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是犯罪就一定会留下痕迹！休想瞒过本侦探！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里就是最后一片区域了，如果还是没有的话......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在这个庄园里，难道凶手真的能做到犯案后不留下任何痕迹吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，从窗外能看到的那个是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（庄园外的......人工湖？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，如果从这个高度可以看到人工湖的话，那案发现场应该也可以！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......就是这个位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的高度已经超过了围墙，而这间房间的窗户，就正对着外面的人工湖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总算被我发现了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下......呼，呼哈，梅缇丝小姐，发生什么事了吗？怎么忽然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到线索了！我终于找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案不是火，而是——水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没有猜错的话，证据就藏在那里......你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......人工湖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是说，凶手将血衣脱下，扔进了庄园外的人工湖里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为已经处在庄园之外，之前我们确实没有搜索过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，海蒂小姐，你是想说如果只是衣物的话，恐怕没有办法扔出这么远的距离，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是仔细想想，我们找不到的，不止是应该存在的血衣吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有凶器啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么没有任何人目击，因为凶手并没有穿着血衣离开犯罪现场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么找不到消失的凶器，因为凶器被裹在沾血的衣物里，一并扔进了湖里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，一切就都说得通了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......如果所有证据都已经被真凶扔进了湖中，想要找到，恐怕没有那么容易......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！只是“没有那么容易”这种程度而已，难不倒本侦探！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是掘地三尺，本侦探也一定会找出证据，将真凶绳之以法——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂这里可是高潮部分！再多给一点反应啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少为我这个名侦探鼓鼓掌吧！一言不发也太过分了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（无言地鼓掌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别吊人胃口，然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能就在这里结束了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦......那当然没结束！然后，然后当、当然是本侦探重振旗鼓，大显神威......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这台词你刚才已经说过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种小事无所谓啦！你是对我的探案历险记有什么意见吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之故事的结尾就是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"已经够久了吧，到底什么时候才能放我们离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"太荒唐了！各位难道真的相信一个小女孩的侦探过家家？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"梅缇丝小姐啊，再不拿出证据，这、这就有点说不过去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呼呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呼，呼呼呼呼，哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在笑什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我当然是在笑愚蠢的真凶，竟然到了这一步，还以为能够逃过本侦探的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的罪犯绝对会留下破绽，找出破绽就是侦探的职责——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证据，我当然已经找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位，本次案件很快就要落幕......请看！这就是能够指证凶手的关键性证据！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......这是哈尔先生昨天穿的那件外套，怎么全都湿透了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"上面的污渍，难道说是血迹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"还有精炼源石摆件......这就是凶器吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来应该没错了，哈尔先生，您要怎么解释这些东西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是个误会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，呃......只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再挣扎了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，这就是小看本侦探的下场！现在证据确凿，乖乖束手就擒吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，梅缇丝小姐，我简直难以想象你是怎么做到的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我必须要承认你这个侦探确实有点本事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族女性&富有的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是名侦探！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......可恶的侦探！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"别想就这样抓到我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想跑！看我的厉害！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！哈！嗬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"肥胖的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"举起手来！不许动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在本侦探面前，没有解决不了的案件！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅缇丝","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本次案件的真凶——就是你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我慢着——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着，等会！这结局明显不对劲吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能进展这么快，一下子就跳到指证凶手的环节啊！这故事也结束得太随便了，其他人的台词明显是你瞎编的吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪哪哪里不对劲了！其他人都被本侦探的英姿折服......这不也很正常吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凛冬我忍你很久了！你这是对本名侦探的挑衅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你要是名侦探，那我就能当警长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这故事前面还好说，结尾编得比那本《嫌疑人伊里奇之死》还烂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你！哼，我才不和你一般见识！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真理！你一定能明白的，对吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅虽然说得稍有些过头，但是故事里确实存在很多没有交代清楚的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，凶手如果将证据丢进人工湖，恐怕是会用血衣包裹着沉重的精炼源石摆件，确保这些证据能够顺利沉入湖底的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，想要短时间内从湖底找到证据，恐怕没有那么容易吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......呃，确实是花了一些时间，我连续好几天都泡在烂泥里，最后警方也参加了搜索，这才找到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不根本就是没你也行嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"线索是我发现的！！而且我在湖底摸了三天泥欸！最后才亲手找到证据！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是迟了一点点而已嘛，最后能指证凶手不就好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？还有什么问题？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"这次虽说恰好保留了证据，顺利找到了你说的血衣和凶器，但如果对方真的使用源石技艺将证据销毁，那样的话要怎么办呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......呃呃呃，其实，这种情况也不算罕见来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般来说，警方会有各种各样的检测方法，专门针对施术者犯罪的情况啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这不还是没你也行嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啰嗦啦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"别的不提，我觉得这种笨蛋侦探和聪明助手的情节，倒还挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之后你再也没有见过这位海蒂小姐了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫别的不提......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那个案子之后没多久，我就遇到了那个可疑的企鹅，一路追着那家伙，开始潜入调查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊不对，没什么，我什么都没说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘘！你们就当没听过潜入调查的事......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......你真觉得自己还在隐藏啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，总之，我在那之后就没有再见过海蒂小姐啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过没关系，身为本名侦探的第一任助手，想必她现在应该也正在大显身手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到我成为家喻户晓的名侦探的那一天，总会有机会再见的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在嘛，作为我名侦探之路的关键一步——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"avg_133_mm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定要先找到那只戴金链子的胖企鹅的犯罪证据才行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]}]}
